                        "review": "It's one of those games I keep coming back to. I still love it just as much, but it is a bit janky in some ways...\r\n\r\nAt some point they added some annoying epic games overlay thing for cross-play, but they didn't fix some annoying bugs or issues like how some menus can't be navigated with a gamepad, or how playstation gamepads seem to be a bit janky sometimes.\r\n\r\nSometimes my gamepad would just make me stare left all the time and I had to use DS4Windows to get it to work properly.\r\n\r\nStill, it's great fun with friends and I would still highly recommend it!",
