            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong> SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS FOR TRINE ENCHANTED EDITION </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8 / 7 / Vista / XP<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz CPU (Dual Core recommended) <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Hard Disk Space:</strong> 4.0 GB \t<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Video Card:</strong> ATi Radeon HD 2400 or NVIDIA GeForce 7600 or better (Shader Model 3.0 needs to be supported)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>DirectX®:</strong> 9.0c<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Sound:</strong> DirectX 9.0c compatible <br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Additional:</strong> *Please note that Trine Enchanted Edition may not run on most Intel graphics solutions used in 2004-2009. The game does run on new (2010-) Intel HD Graphics 3000 or better.</li></ul><br><strong> SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS FOR TRINE </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP, Windows Vista or Windows 7<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz CPU (Dual-core recommended)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB (XP), 1 GB (Vista)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Hard Disk Space:</strong> 4.0 GB<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Video Card:</strong> Radeon X800 or GeForce 6800 or better*<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>DirectX®:</strong> 9.0c<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Sound:</strong> DirectX compatible soundcard (not required)<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Additional:</strong> Gamepads required for co-op play.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<br><br>*Please note that Trine does not run on most Intel integrated graphics chipsets.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul><br><strong> SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS FOR TRINE </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>SO:</strong> Windows XP, Windows Vista ou Windows 7 </li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> CPU de 2.0 GHz (Dual-core recomendado) </li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 512 MB (XP), 1 GB (Vista) </li><li><strong>Disco Rígido:</strong> 600 MB de espaço livre </li><li><strong>Gráfica:</strong> Radeon X800 ou GeForce 6800 ou melhor* </li><li><strong>DirectX®:</strong> 9.0c </li><li><strong>Som:</strong> Placa de som compatível com DirectX (não necessário) </li><li><strong>Adicional:</strong> Controladores necessários para jogo cooperativo. <br><br>*Por favor tenha em atenção que o Trine não funciona na maioria dos chipsets gráficos integrados da Intel. </li></ul>"
            },
            "mac_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong> SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS FOR TRINE ENCHANTED EDITION </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X version Lion 10.7, or later.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Mac<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Hard Disk Space:</strong> 4.0 GB\t<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Video Card:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 8600M or better / ATi Radeon 2400 or better*<br><br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t*NOTE: Please be advised that Trine Enchanted Edition does not run on Intel graphics solutions used in 2006-2008. The game does run on new (2010-) Intel HD Graphics 3000 or better. Macs with NVIDIA GeForce 9400M or ATi Radeon X1600 may not achieve smooth gameplay.<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li><li><strong>Additional:</strong> Keyboard, Mouse/Trackpad with Secondary click enabled<br>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li></ul><br><strong> SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS FOR TRINE </strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>SO:</strong> OS X versão Leopard 10.5.8, ou mais recente. </li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Mac </li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 1GB de RAM </li><li><strong>Disco Rígido:</strong> 600 MB de espaço livre </li><li><strong>Gráfica:</strong> Placa gráfica compatível com OpenGL 2.0 com 256 MB de RAM partilhados ou dedicados (ATI ou NVIDIA) </li><li><strong>Necessário:</strong> Teclado, Rato com clique Secundário ativo. </li><li><strong>Adicional:</strong> Por favor tenha em atenção que o jogo não funciona em soluções gráficas da Intel (como MacBooks de 2006 a 2008) com a única exceção dos novos modelos MacBook Pro 2011. O jogo funciona na maioria dos Macs de 2009 para cima que tenham um chip gráfico distinto (NVIDIA/ATI). Macs com gráficas NVIDIA GeForce 9400M ou ATI Radeon X1600 podem não chegar para um boa experiência de jogo. </li></ul>"
            },
            "linux_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong> SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS FOR TRINE ENCHANTED EDITION </strong><br><strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Built and tested against Ubuntu 12.04 LTS. This is a legacy native build and is not actively tested against current distributions.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.2 GHz dual-core<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> ATI Radeon HD 2400 or NVIDIA GeForce 7600 or better, with OpenGL 2.1 support<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1.5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional:</strong> Runs best with proprietary graphics drivers and may not behave correctly with open source drivers.<br></li><li><strong>Note:</strong> Your purchase includes the Windows and macOS versions at no extra cost. On SteamOS and Steam Deck, running the Windows version through Proton may give better results than the native Linux build.</li></ul><strong> SYSTEM REQUIREMENTS FOR TRINE (ORIGINAL VERSION) </strong><br>The original 2009 version of Trine is included with Trine Enchanted Edition on Windows and macOS only. There is no Linux build of the original version."
            },
